// right and one to the left (section 1), two turns of 90° to the right (section 2), a hairpin to
// the left and the last straight (section 3), the finish line (point 94), the run-out (to point
// 113); then the way back (never built nor driven) round to the lead-in (from point 127), the
// straight where the grid stands, behind point 0.
//
